Direct access with literal index:
boxes(0).w =  100
boxes(1).w =  80
boxes(2).w =  150

Access with variable index:
boxes( 0).x =  10
boxes( 0).y =  10
boxes( 0).w =  100
boxes( 0).h =  50

boxes( 1).x =  120
boxes( 1).y =  20
boxes( 1).w =  80
boxes( 1).h =  60

boxes( 2).x =  50
boxes( 2).y =  80
boxes( 2).w =  150
boxes( 2).h =  40

Testing multiple args on one line:
 10 10 100 50
 120 20 80 60
 50 80 150 40

